		"description": "<p>Kinetic Pulse Gloves — commonly known as Repulser Gloves, merging the words “Repulse” and “Pulser” — are a personal defense armament that project a wave or bubble of kinetic force from a projector in the palm or on the knuckles. The force of this is considerable, but the weapon is normally non-lethal, spreading the impact over a wide enough area that the effect leaves a target knocked over, disoriented, and winded, but with no lasting injuries.</p><p>The profile for a Repulser Glove can be found in the Security Weapons Table at the start of this section.</p>",
